n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Stench]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":10,"slug":"stench","traits":["olfactory"]}],"slug":"stench","traits":{"value":["aura","olfactory"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.YzGXgyojcjzXVipz"},{"_id":"dSMYHVMIltxeN4ms","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"void-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.dSMYHVMIltxeN4ms"},{"_id":"7RTjFlVzsxhjtwX4","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.ixPqVlqLaYTB1b23"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Consume Flesh","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The ghoul is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ghoul devours a chunk of the corpse and regains @Damage[1d6[healing]] Hit Points.</p>\n<p>It can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghoul-consume-flesh","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.7RTjFlVzsxhjtwX4"},{"_id":"jShRo5PDthe4aFDT","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.pOW2IvfVusdmD5v5"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Ghoul Whispers","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} creature is within the ghoul's reach</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The ghoul whispers dark thoughts and vile cravings into the creature's ears. The creature must save against the forbidden cravings curse.</p>\n<p><strong>Forbidden Cravings</strong> (curse) A creature can still eat and drink while sickened by this curse</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[will|dc:17|traits:curse]</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effects (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[2d6[void]] damage and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} until it consumes raw meat (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> as stage 2</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> as stage 2 unless the target has consumed raw meat in the past 24 hours, then it takes @Damage[4d6[void]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} until it consumes raw meat;</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> if the creature has eaten raw meat in the past 24 hours, it dies and rises as a ghoul, if not, it returns to stage 4</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghoul-ghoul-whispers","traits":{"value":["auditory","linguistic","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.jShRo5PDthe4aFDT"},{"_id":"Eio9qRZi4Wxz6XXD","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.227zB1x6U0TyU1nd"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Grave Knowledge","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>[[/r 1d20+7]]{+7} skill modifier</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ghoul calls upon knowledge it retains from one creature it has consumed in the past 7 days. The ghoul attempts a skill check using a skill in which the consumed creature was trained (if it's unclear whether the creature was trained, the GM decides). The ghoul is treated as trained and uses the high skill modifier for the ghoul's level. This takes the same amount of actions or time as usual for the check.</p>\n<p>The ghoul can instead automatically learn something specific known by a creature it consumed in the last 7 days, like the location of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} treasure or the name of a loved one. The ghoul can do this only once for a given creature, no matter how much of its flesh the ghoul consumed.</p>"},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"PT1H"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghoul-grave-knowledge","traits":{"value":["occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.Eio9qRZi4Wxz6XXD"},{"_id":"rvraBop9oOSwcjkq","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.UU1Fp3PRuTFONjC9"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Swift Leap","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The ghoul jumps up to half its Speed. This movement doesn't trigger reactions.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghoul-swift-leap","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["move"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.rvraBop9oOSwcjkq"},{"_id":"NaSXwkNPzNz5tsgw","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"grab","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv.NaSXwkNPzNz5tsgw"}],"name":"Ghoul Stalker","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":1},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":1},"str":{"mod":1},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":17},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":16,"temp":0,"value":16},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"death-effects"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"disease"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"paralyzed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"poison"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"unconscious"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"bleed"}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":5}],"value":25}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["common","necril"]},"level":{"value":1},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Ghouls stalkers are ravenous undead who haunt graveyards and eat corpses.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Few creatures are more ubiquitous to sinister locations such as lonely graveyards and ruined crypts than the flesh-eating undead known as ghouls.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":7,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":4},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":9},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":5}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":7},"athletics":{"base":8},"stealth":{"base":7},"survival":{"base":5}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["ghoul","undead","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.iLkQt8A99nQWUI8k"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!ohqgVmgfeNAsMUkv","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/shared/ghoul-stalker.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"shared__pathfinder_monster_core__ghoul_stalker","sourcePack":"pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core","sourceDocId":"iLkQt8A99nQWUI8k"}}}